<title>THAILAND: Media and Medias sets 3.00 baht 1996 div.</title>
<headline>Media and Medias sets 3.00 baht 1996 div.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  3.00    vs     2.00</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 9, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	May 30, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Media and Medias Plc is a media company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662-652-0642)</p>
